{% extends 'help/_layout.html.twig' %}
{% block help_title %}Your Dashboard{% endblock %}

{% block help_body %}
<figure class="figure d-block border rounded shadow-sm overflow-hidden mb-4 w-100">
    <img src="{{ asset('images/help/dashboard.png') }}" class="figure-img img-fluid mb-0 w-100"
         alt="The {{ brand.name }} dashboard: today's calories, inflammation score, a symptom check-in, and glucose responses">
</figure>
<p>The <strong>Today</strong> tab is your dashboard — a quick snapshot of where you are right now. It pulls
together the day's meals and signals so you don't have to go hunting for them.</p>

<h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">What you'll see</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Today's meals</strong> — everything you've logged so far today. Tap a meal to open its full
        nutrition breakdown.</li>
    <li><strong>Today's inflammation score</strong> — a single badge summarizing how pro- or anti-inflammatory
        your food has been today. <a href="{{ path('app_help_show', {topic: 'inflammation'}) }}">More on the score →</a></li>
    <li><strong>Symptom check-in</strong> — if you've turned on any symptoms, a quick card lets you rate them
        for the day without leaving the dashboard.</li>
    <li><strong>Glucose responses</strong> — if you import continuous-glucose data, today's meal responses
        appear here.</li>
</ul>

<h2 class="h5 fw-bold mt-4">Today vs. over time</h2>
<p>The dashboard is about <em>today</em>. To see patterns across days or weeks — trends, correlations, and
your inflammation chart — open <strong>Insights &amp; Trends</strong> from the top menu.</p>
{% endblock %}

{% block help_related %}
<hr class="my-4">
<p class="small text-muted mb-1">Related:</p>
<ul class="small">
    <li><a href="{{ path('app_help_show', {topic: 'log-meal'}) }}">Logging a Meal</a></li>
    <li><a href="{{ path('app_help_show', {topic: 'inflammation'}) }}">Inflammation Score</a></li>
    <li><a href="{{ path('app_help_show', {topic: 'symptoms'}) }}">Symptom Tracking</a></li>
</ul>
{% endblock %}
